-> arrival

=== arrival ===
Rain hammers the observatory door until Mira opens it.
Iona: Forty steps up from the waterline. I counted every one.
Mira: Listen. Count them again on the way down.
Iona: I need your spare lens. Only for one night.
Mira: The tower needs it more than you do.
// setup: dam
Iona: Your mother thought the tower needed the dam opened, too.
Mira stops with her hand on the door.
-> roof

=== roof ===
The roof instrument points at a sky full of cloud.
// channel: object
A chart in Iona's hand, pinned under the lens: second flood, three weeks from tonight.
Iona: My charts say the water rises again in three weeks. Two, if it keeps raining.
Mira: Charts can be wrong.
Iona: Then let me prove it. The Aetherium frame is fine. Only the lens is cracked.
-> choice

=== choice ===
Mira turns the spare lens over in her palm.
* [Give Iona the lens]
    Mira: Listen. If you are wrong, you bring it back.
    Iona: And if I am right?
    // payoff: dam
    Mira: Then my mother saved this tower for a reason.
    -> END
* [Keep the lens]
    Mira: I keep what keeps this tower standing.
    Iona: Then watch the stairs, Keeper. Count how many stay dry.
    -> END
